	(text "VCOMP (Highest voltage mode)\n(V_{OV} - V_{DIODE}) * R_{BOT} / (R_{BOT} + R_{TOP}) = 1.06V\nV_{OV} = 1.06 * (5k + 16.9k) / 5k + 0.9 = 5.54V\nI_{LM} = 65.2 / R_{ILM}(k)^{0.861} = 65.2 / 21.5^{0.861} = 4.64A"
